+# Alder Bay Rental Shortlist
+
+## Search criteria
+
+- Move-in: 2026-09-15
+- Allowed neighborhoods: Old Harbor or River Market
+- Bedrooms: Exactly 2
+- Floor: Above ground floor
+- Cats: Allowed
+- Laundry: In-unit
+- Lease term: 12 months
+- Parking: Optional
+- Transit: 35 minutes or less to Bayview Medical Center for a weekday 08:30 arrival
+- Ranking: Lowest monthly total, then shortest commute
+
+## Ranked shortlist
+
+The corrected criteria leave three rentals. Monthly totals include rent and every mandatory recurring monthly fee in the packet; optional parking is not included.
+
+| Rank | Listing ID | Property / unit | Neighborhood | Available | Rent | Mandatory recurring fees | Monthly total | Transit commute | Lease term | Why it qualifies |
+|---:|---|---|---|---|---:|---|---:|---|---:|---|
+| 1 | ALD-104 | Marketline House / 7B | River Market | 2026-09-10 | $2,450.00 | $80.00 — Water $35.00; trash $20.00; building fee $25.00 | $2,530.00 | 32 minutes — Route M2 then B Line | 12 months | Available before the corrected move-in date and located in the allowed River Market neighborhood; this two-bedroom is above ground, allows a cat, has in-unit laundry, meets the lease term, and stays within the transit limit. |
+| 2 | ALD-207 | Harbor Loom Flats / 4C | Old Harbor | 2026-09-01 | $2,380.00 | $165.00 — Water $40.00; internet $60.00; amenity fee $65.00 | $2,545.00 | 29 minutes — Harbor Tram then Route 6 | 12 months | Available before the corrected move-in date and located in the allowed Old Harbor neighborhood; this two-bedroom is above ground, allows a cat, has in-unit laundry, meets the lease term, and stays within the transit limit. |
+| 3 | ALD-318 | Quayside Foundry / 5A | Old Harbor | 2026-08-30 | $2,425.00 | $135.00 — Water $35.00; internet $55.00; amenity fee $45.00 | $2,560.00 | 24 minutes — Foundry Shuttle then B Line | 12 months | Available before the corrected move-in date and located in the allowed Old Harbor neighborhood; this two-bedroom is above ground, allows a cat, has in-unit laundry, meets the lease term, and stays within the transit limit. |
+
+## Recommendation
+
+Choose Marketline House, unit 7B, because its $2,530.00 monthly total is the lowest among all rentals that meet the corrected criteria. The trade-off is its 32-minute commute, which is the longest of the three finalists even though it remains within the 35-minute limit. Parking is optional, so its separate optional garage charge does not affect the retained cost-first ranking.
+
+## Trade-offs and checks
+
+- ALD-104 is the lowest-cost finalist at $2,530.00 monthly, but its 32-minute commute is 3 minutes longer than ALD-207 and 8 minutes longer than ALD-318.
+- ALD-207 costs $15.00 more per month than the winner, largely because of its higher mandatory fee total, while shortening the commute to 29 minutes.
+- ALD-318 has the highest monthly total at $2,560.00, but its 24-minute commute is the shortest and saves 8 minutes relative to the winner.
